# foundry local overlay

Copy to ~/.config/foundry/local.md and edit. Foundry reads it before its seed table and never copies it into a repo.

store: ~/code/my-skills (repo example-user/my-skills; add an entry to sources.yaml and open a PR)

| Theme | Provider | Kind (skill/mcp/tool) | License | Link | Fallback |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| intent | papers search (my-search MCP) | mcp | n/a | self-hosted |  |
| design-system | image generation (my-images MCP) | mcp | n/a | https://mcp.example.internal |  |

Notes:

- Find these tools with mcp_tool_search.
